*20
/A LITTLE BOY RAN HOME
/HER DOG ATE THE FOOD
/WE SAW THEM BY THE STREAM
/SHE TOOK OUR BOOKS AWAY
/ALL DRINKS COST THE SAME
/BEING ALONE CAN BE SAD
/HE WORKED ALL DAY LONG
/STUDENTS LEAD GOOD LIVES
/MY WIFE LIKES TO COOK
/THEIR SON WAS VERY TALL
/MARY WAS STANDING THERE BEFORE
/THE BOX WAS PUT UPSTAIRS
/THE FISH WE CAUGHT TASTED GOOD
/WE DRANK THE WINE QUICKLY
/THEY DROVE TO THE WEST COAST
/OUR NEIGHBORS CAME FOR DINNER
/SHE WALKED DOWN BY THE RIVER
/BIRDS FLY SOUTH TO KEEP WARM
/THE HEAT WAS VERY HARD TO TAKE
/THE NEWS WAS SHOCKING TODAY
